1
00:00:14,352 --> 00:00:17,636
Bonjour, Marinette !
Hello, Marinette!

2
00:00:17,736 --> 00:00:22,988
Bonjour, Adrien ! Bienvenue chez moi.
Hello, Adrien! Welcome to my home.

3
00:00:23,088 --> 00:00:27,236
Merci. Je peux entrer ?
Thank you. May I come in?

4
00:00:27,336 --> 00:00:32,852
Oui, bien sûr. Entrez, s'il vous plaît.
Yes, of course. Come in, please.

5
00:00:32,952 --> 00:00:36,428
Voici un petit cadeau pour vous.
Here is a small gift for you.

6
00:00:36,528 --> 00:00:40,076
Merci, c'est très gentil.
Thank you, that's very kind.

7
00:00:40,176 --> 00:00:43,172
La maison est très belle.
The house is very beautiful.

8
00:00:43,272 --> 00:00:46,652
Vous voulez entrer dans le salon ?
Would you like to come into the living room?

9
00:00:46,752 --> 00:00:49,628
Oui, volontiers.
Yes, gladly.
